flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser / demo user] --> API[TypeScript API]
  API --> Hybrid[Hybrid search: sparse vector + keyword]
  Hybrid --> IDs[Candidate document and chunk IDs]
  IDs --> FGA[FGA batch document ID check]
  FGA -->|Allowed IDs| Live[Live source access and version re-check]
  FGA -->|Zero allowed| Fixed[Fixed no-result response]
  Live -->|Denied or deleted| Fixed
  Live -->|New version| Refresh[Re-chunk and re-embed]
  Refresh --> Context[Authorized fresh context]
  Live -->|Current version| Context
  Context --> LLM[LLMClient / Hunyuan boundary]
  LLM --> Checker[Citation output checker]
  Checker --> API
  API --> Audit[Hash-chain audit log]
  Audit --> Merkle[Merkle sealer and proof]
  Merkle --> Compliance[Compliance console]

  subgraph Sources[Mock source platforms]
    Slack[Slack]
    Jira[Jira]
    Confluence[Confluence]
    Drive[Drive]
  end

  Sources --> Sync[Resumable sync and ID deletion pass]
  Sources --> Live
  Sync -->|Content hash change| Refresh
  Sync -->|Permission hash change| FGA
  Sync -->|Missing ID| Tombstone[Tombstone]
  Tombstone --> Hybrid

  Admin[Mock admin] -->|Source edit webhook simulation| Sources
  Admin -->|Narrow tier only| FGA
  Orchestrator[Headless periodic orchestrator] --> Sync
